{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/671214-tears-of-the-emerald-mother","id":671214,"title":"Tears of the Emerald Mother","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-19T12:58:04-07:00","id":671214,"title":"Tears of the Emerald Mother","content":"Long time WtA storyteller looking to run a Hengeyokai game, preferably over Hangouts and utilizing Roll20. I'm in the Eastern Standard Timezone. If I can't generate enough interest in that and or there is interest in other time zones, I'd be willing to give PBP a try. I've advertised for this before, but there never seems to be a lot of interest in it. I'm not sure why, but I have a few theories. One is simply that most people prefer the core game, which is, of course, about Werewolves. This is fair and, for the most part, I'm with you on that. This is the first time I've tried a game set in Asia and it really just stems from my wanting to challenge myself as a storyteller. I have never set a game in a foreign culture/setting, and I want to give a little bit of an exotic spin to the core themes of Werewolf and the World of Darkness in general. I intend to set the game in Rakhine State, Myanmar (Burma) somewhere between 2012 and the present. Currently (IRL), there is quite a bit of upheaval there due to the persecution of the Rohingya (a Muslim ethnic minority). I plan to weave those events into the game and examine them &quot;through the mirror darkly&quot; of the World of Darkness. I also don't intend for this to devlove into a wushu/anime stile slugfest like Exalted (which is a great game- just not what I'd like to do here). Its going to be dark and its going to be grimy, just in an exotic local. If this sounds like something you'd be interested in, feel free to reach out to me. <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#9fd2feebebf7fae8b1c8fee6f1fab1d3eaebe5dff8f2fef6f3b1fcf0f2\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"44092530302c21336a13253d2a216a0831303e042329252d286a272b29\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6039-mattlutz","name":"MattLutz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}